    "name": "luh-algorithmic-workflows-for-the-design-of-internal-structures-to-enhance-the-thermal-performance",
    "notes": "This dataset contains two algorithmic workflows for the design of internal structures aimed at enhancing thermal performance.\r\n\r\nOne script follows a strut-based approach (*strut_based_algorithm.gh*), while the other employs mathematical functions to describe the surface geometry (*mathematical_based_algorithm.gh*).\r\n\r\nSupplementary data for *\"__Design of Internal Structures to Enhance the Thermal Performance of Additively Manufactured Heat Exchangers__.\"*\r\n\r\nBoth workflows were developed and tested using the following software:\r\n\r\n* __Grasshopper__ 1.0.0007\r\n* __Rhino__ Version 7 SR37\r\n\r\nRequired plugins:\r\n\r\n* __Axolotl__ (2021-05-19)\r\n* __IntraLattice__ (0.8.1)",
